msgstr "The next example demonstrates the ``BoltzmannMachine`` class:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:20
msgid "2. 使用不同的采样器"
msgstr "2\\. Using Different Samplers"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:22
msgid "Kaiwu SDK 提供多种采样器，您可以根据需求选择："
msgstr "Kaiwu SDK offers several samplers; pick the one that best fits your needs:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:36
msgid ""
"如果已配置 Kaiwu SDK 授权并取得真机访问权限，可将经典采样器替换为 README 中使用的 CIM 采样器，并使用 "
"`PrecisionReducer` 适配硬件精度："
msgstr "After configuring Kaiwu SDK authorization and obtaining real-hardware access, you can replace the classical sampler with the CIM sampler used in the README and use `PrecisionReducer` to adapt to hardware precision:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid "详细的采样器接口与训练循环请参阅 {doc}`tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch`。"
msgstr "For the detailed sampler interface and training loop, see {doc}`tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch`."

